flowchart TB
  UI[TSD React workbench\nchat/catalog/chart/book/execution/portfolio]
  CTRL[Authenticated TSD control API\nregistry/deployments/approvals/read models]
  AG[Research/strategy/risk/portfolio agents\nread + proposal tools]
  BRIDGE[Target-position and engine event bridge]
  ENGINE[Adopted trading engine\nstrategy runtime | OMS/EMS | risk | portfolio | backtest | sandbox]
  POLICY[TSD policy/audit layer\npermissions | allocation | approvals | kill switch]
  DATA[Engine data adapters + TSD DSM where needed]
  BROKER[Binance | Bybit | Interactive Brokers | Alpaca\ncTrader only after certification]
  STORE[(PostgreSQL/TimescaleDB\nregistry/audit/read models)]
  ARCH[(Parquet/object storage\nmarket datasets/replay)]
  BUS[(Durable event bus)]
  UI --> CTRL
  CTRL --> BRIDGE
  CTRL --> AG
  AG --> POLICY
  POLICY --> BRIDGE
  BRIDGE --> ENGINE
  DATA --> ENGINE
  ENGINE --> BROKER
  ENGINE --> BUS
  ENGINE --> STORE
  CTRL --> STORE
  DATA --> ARCH
  BUS --> CTRL
